 if not args.final:print(json.dumps({'status':phase,'selected':'FIXED_50_50','artifact_close_pending':True}));return
 table='| Recipe | V-B | V-A | V-A non-retrieval | CLEAN (V-B) |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n'
 for name,q in recipes.items():table+=f"| {name} | {fmt(point(q) if 'VB' in q else None)} | {fmt(point(q,'VA') if 'VA' in q else None)} | {fmt(point(q,'VA','nonretrieval') if 'VA' in q else None)} | {fmt(point(q,'VB','CLEAN') if 'VB' in q else None)} |\n"
 gap='| Metric | Selected P | Distance to 0.90 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n'
 for name,value in [('V-B',point(P)),('V-A',point(P,'VA')),('V-A non-retrieval',point(P,'VA','nonretrieval')),('CLEAN V-B',point(P,'VB','CLEAN'))]:gap+=f'| {name} | {value:.8f} | {.9-value:.8f} |\n'
 report=f'''# Return to SS — RS-DEFHS-SYSTEM3-WAVE1-001\n\nSTATUS: {phase}\n\nBranch: rs/system3-wave1-001. Starting HEAD: d78da6037ec1b73bf210f562baa30ebb1b9fa9e6. Final closure HEAD is the commit containing this report, returned explicitly in chat and the deliverable snapshot; it cannot be embedded in its own Git commit.\n\nW1.0: PASS. All registered authority/cache/baseline hashes, 826 train /209 test IDs, four class supports and retrieval78 rows/77 groups verified. No protected artifact read.\n\n{table}\n## CPU pair and nesting\n\nFixed pair V-B folds: {json.dumps(P['VB']['fold_macro_f1'])}. Fold deltas versus accepted control: {json.dumps(P['VB']['fold_deltas'])}. Repairs/breakages: {P['VB']['corrections']}/{P['VB']['breakages']}. All five leave-one-fold gains remain positive. All four class F1 directions improve in V-B and V-A. Retrieval-aware V-A: {selected['retrieval_aware_VA']:.10f}, using the unchanged certified audit232 covered rows.\n\nNested fitting improves V-B +0.0065466 with five positive fold deltas but loses V-A nonretrieval -0.0032893 versus P. Keep fixed50/50. All fitted temperatures/weights used legal train-side inner predictions, excluding the outer fold; no global-OOF meta-training substitute.\n\nScientific robustness: fixed P's old conservative simultaneous bound crosses zero. Competition evidence: material +0.0384411 V-B, five positive folds/deletions, +0.0249879 V-A, +0.0360985 nonretrieval and +0.0381967 CLEAN. This is conditional reused validation, not independent confirmation. Source/Q diagnostics remain in the compact results; int32 has a small VB regression and positive VA direction. No subgroup routing was created.\n\n## Adaptation and fixed marginal members\n\nStrict A0=A1={point(corr['matched_frozen']):.10f}, epochs[0,0,0,0,0]. The pilot-trained C1/scaler on three blocks is reused by the four-block zero-step refit, preserving literal identical initialization. This matched A0 differs from W1.1's four-block accepted control. Original implementation rebuilt the head/scaler on four blocks; that defect was recovered mechanically from verified pilot states on CPU, with stopping-loss parity, without training/encoder inference. Raw outputs remain immutable. No encoder update was retained, and top4 adaptation was not reached. Do not interpret this as general encoder failure. Corrected Candidate_A delta is {bl['arms']['A']['results']['VB']['aggregate_delta']:+.10f}; no secondary entry.\n\nAST seed1 B0→B1: {point(recipes['AST B0']):.10f}→{point(recipes['AST B1 seed1']):.10f} V-B, +0.0460416; four positive folds, positive CLEAN and all four class directions. Separately trained V-A:0.6347053→0.6842362; nonretrieval0.5965367→0.6272971. Same mild SpecAugment in matched arms, full clip windows and clip-level probability averaging/NLL.\n\nOnly B1 received seed20260917. Table reports seed1, seed2 and arithmetic mean separately. Seed2's frozen reference is seed1 B0; it is a stability contrast, not a separately matched frozen-arm experiment. The seed mean passes the old conservative conditional gate against that weak frozen comparator; it remains much weaker than P. Fixed Candidate_B seed1/seed2/mean V-B deltas: {bl['arms']['B']['results']['VB']['aggregate_delta']:+.8f}, {s2b['fixed_blends']['B']['results']['VB']['aggregate_delta']:+.8f}, {s2b['seed_stability']['B']['fixed_blend_mean_vs_pair']['VB']['aggregate_delta']:+.8f}. None meets the registered promotion conventions. No rescued weights, offsets, thresholds or new recipe.\n\n## Target and SS decisions\n\n{gap}\nPromoted within Wave1 for SS deployment review: original frozen emotion2vec+C1, cached original XLS-R+C1, uniform50/50 probabilities. Certified retrieval remains unchanged and separate. Accepted submitted control/FINAL_SYSTEM_LOCK was not changed.\n\nNot promoted: A1 and corrected Candidate_A; AST standalone/recovered seeds and all registered AST marginal blends. AST adaptation's matched gain remains a supported finding, not a negative result. Inconclusive/not promoted: nested fusion because its secondary nonretrieval direction fails concordance.\n\nDominant measured residual: {errors}/826 wrong V-B labels; {ns} neutral↔sad errors. No proof of representation failure/label ambiguity/achievable oracle ceiling. Exact Wave2 trigger: registered Wave1 is closed and target gaps remain; SS must authorize the accepted next-wave contract. Wave2/3 were not executed.\n\nPublic recommendation: SS review one controlled external test of uniform P; no claimed public/private gain or0.90 success. System1 public0.79691, System2 public0.78593; PUBLIC_TRANSFER_NEGATIVE preserves the prior positive internal diagnostics and demonstrates the post-diagnostic source gate failed fresh public transfer. Private score unknown.\n\nCompute: CPU pair/nested wall {compute['CPU_pair_wall_seconds']:.3f}s; {compute['fit_count']} GPU pilot/refit records, summed fit wall {compute['GPU_fit_wall_seconds_sum']:.3f}s ({compute['GPU_fit_wall_seconds_sum']/3600:.3f}h), peakGPU memory {compute['GPU_peak_memory_bytes']} bytes. Fit wall excludes parent preparation/outer inference and overlaps workers; it is not billed GPU time. Account quota: GPU13.35h used /16.65h remaining; increase6.84h since preflight6.51h. Initial A finished early while the single B worker continued; subsequent AST jobs split folds over both T4s. CPU initializer recovery used zero optimizer steps; no measured duration is invented.\n\nDrive: gdrive:DEFHS/rs_system3_wave1_001. All registered objects byte-verified, zero differences. Heavy master manifest SHA256: {evidence['heavy_manifest_sha256']}. Exact per-phase proofs and logical inventory are in HEAVY_ARTIFACT_MANIFEST.json /CHECKPOINT_PROVENANCE.json.\n\nProtected validation: NOT READ. Public LB selection: NO. Kaggle competition submission: NO. No model zoo, Wave2/3, manual source routing or extra second seeds.\n\nGit closure: intentional files committed/pushed on rs/system3-wave1-001; final tracked-clean/remote-parity check accompanies the chat return; .tmp preserved untracked. No merge to main.\n\nUnresolved scientific/technical blockers: NONE after the proved epoch-zero initialization recovery. Next SS decisions: whether to externally test uniform P, and authorize the accepted Wave2 contract. Stop after this return.\n'''
 (RUN/'FINAL_RETURN_TO_SS.md').write_text(report)
